    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d385">

                <pb facs="0499" n="419" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg419"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">President Loubet to
                        President Roosevelt</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-09-04"><hi rendition="#small-caps">September</hi> 4,
                            1902</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The report of the awful accident to which you came near falling a victim has just
                    reached me, and I hear that you have happily escaped. I wish to express to you
                    my very sincere felicitations and to renew to you the assurance of my constant
                    friendship.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Emilé Loubet</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
